cher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2294773","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T00:27:51.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"n466im84oajezmzrwe3ynmjnb"}]},{"label":"政策与宏观","summary":"欧盟收紧非合规稳定币服务，俄罗斯完成首批交易与托管机构登记，中东能源通道风险持续上升。","items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美联储会议纪要：多数官员认为年底前再加息一次或较合适","summary":"美联储公布的9月货币政策会议纪要显示，全体与会官员均支持将联邦基金利率目标区间上调25个基点至3.75%至4.00%，多数官员认为年底前再加息一次可能是适当的。官员们普遍认为通胀风险偏向上行，部分官员指出，AI基础设施建设可能导致中期总需求超过总供给。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a11799-c97b-723b-8556-17982c9784f3","publishedAt":"2026-10-07T18:20:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"lnqrn8qticowj80ntqxgizrt5"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/0bbfd8b9f25f24983634e6e6abd82994e0befec127adb0ea475e2dab16084c08.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp 96w","itemId":"cyyadg6wfavu8k9w933d40k9v","title":"中共中央、国务院印发《关于发展新质生产力的意见》","summary":"中共中央、国务院印发《关于发展新质生产力的意见》，围绕科技创新、产业融合、发展方式、体制机制和人才工作机制提出5方面19项重点举措。文件提出全面实施“人工智能+”行动、加大金融创新产品供给，并要求因地制宜推进，防止一哄而上、盲目投资和产业泡沫化。","sourceName":"东方财富","sourceUrl":"http://finance.eastmoney.com/news/1345,202610093891348451.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-09T10:01:08.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"ESMA要求加密服务商停止提供非MiCA合规稳定币服务并在3个月内清退","summary":"ESMA要求欧盟加密资产服务提供商停止向欧盟客户提供涉及非MiCA合规稳定币的交易、兑换、托管、转账及投资建议等服务，并阻止客户买入或增持。存量敞口须在3个月内、最迟2027年1月8日前清理完毕，期间仅可提供卖出、兑换和提取等有限退出服务。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a11b05-15cf-7453-a5c5-29e037255063","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T10:17:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"emphoyx57gp8qvagk3omsqe49"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"特朗普成立委员会调查 Lisa Cook，解职程序将如何推进","summary":"特朗普成立委员会，评估是否有理由解职美联储理事 Lisa Cook。委员会将于 11 月 5 日在白宫举行听证，Cook 可由律师陪同，并在 11 月 10 日前补充回应，随后委员会向特朗普提出建议。最终决定权在特朗普，但解职决定仍可能接受最高法院审查；Cook 预计仍将参加 10 月 28 日的利率投票，委员会成立不会立即改变利率。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/09/trump-lisa-cook-fed-firing-committee-explained.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-09T18:20:57.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"pw6aj5t8lrc70dgnh1vtssafi"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":"e1e3k3ms17kza35bq6qgt9bkt","title":"霍尔木兹海峡油轮袭击升至战争以来高位，伊朗施压原油出口","summary":"霍尔木兹海峡油轮遇袭次数激增，结束于10月4日的一周内有11艘油轮遭袭，本周另有5艘遇袭。IMO数据显示，自战争开始以来，100艘商业船在霍尔木兹海峡、波斯湾和阿曼湾遭袭，至少24名船员死亡；截至周三，经海峡运输的原油降至8.5 million bpd，较战前正常水平低约40%。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/09/iran-war-strait-hormuz-tanker-attack-oil.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-09T18:02:01.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"俄罗斯批准首批加密交易所及托管机构，Sberbank计划12月推出加密产品","summary":"俄罗斯央行宣布已根据9月1日起生效的新加密监管法规，登记首批加密货币交易运营商和数字资产托管机构，首批名单共4家交易运营商和5家托管机构，VTB同时入选两份名单，俄罗斯最大银行Sberbank也在其中。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a11583-8f50-73ce-b0da-7e75e0fc0068","publishedAt":"2026-10-07T08:33:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"msxg9gvmzg9tc0are3fi42di5"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"胡塞武装袭击利雅得机场及阿美炼油厂，红海能源通道风险升温","summary":"也门胡塞武装对沙特本土发动三轮大规模打击，动用弹道导弹、巡航导弹及无人机袭击利雅得哈立德国王国际机场、拉比格阿美炼油厂等目标，利雅得机场空中交通一度中断。沙特支持的也门政府军同期启动代号“也门黎明”的大规模军事行动，双方在曼德海峡及摩卡港归属上说法分歧。冲突令市场对中东能源供应稳定性的担忧升温，红海航运保险成本与原油风险溢价或持续重估。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783045","publishedAt":"2026-10-06T01:28:31.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"voj55j38tobncbt6urcyehtut"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"c1ilyg92ggjlaa6fo7qyfghma","title":"美国放松俄罗斯柴油贸易制裁，特朗普称俄将向美供油","summary":"美国财政部下属外国资产控制办公室宣布放松俄罗斯柴油贸易相关制裁，授权销售、交付、卸货或进口柴油的许可持续至美东时间2027年4月7日零时。特朗普称俄罗斯将立即向美国及世界市场提供超过30万吨柴油，11月提供50万吨，此后再提供100万吨。美国9日柴油平均零售价格为每加仑6.2785美元，同比上涨70.8%。","sourceName":"经济观察网","sourceUrl":"http://www.eeo.com.cn/2026/1010/1059306.shtml","publishedAt":"2026-10-10T01:52:10.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true}]},{"label":"股票市场","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"特朗普8月买入至多2500万美元Meta股票和500万美元SpaceX债券","summary":"美国总统特朗普披露8月进行517笔证券交易，其中包括买入价值500万至2500万美元的Meta股票，以及买入价值100万至500万美元、票息5.35%并于2031年7月到期的SpaceX高级无担保票据。特朗普的账户当月买入额至少为4420万美元、卖出额至少为3010万美元；他在买入SpaceX票据两天后签署了扩大美国商业航天运输的政策。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/08/trump-august-trades-meta-spacex-financial-disclosure.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T13:18:47.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"b8623pzm8ppu1gk59ijz7mj0l"}]},{"label":"行业动态","summary":"SpaceX拓展移动通信业务，安踏完成收购彪马股权，人工智能数据中心与初创融资市场出现分化。","items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":"e0m6sk534sqitbzpennqr6wfw","title":"SpaceX收购800MHz频谱进军美国移动运营商市场","summary":"SpaceX宣布从Grain Management LLC收购覆盖全美的800MHz低频频谱牌照，并计划将其与Starlink卫星网络整合，打造独立的移动运营商业务。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783231","publishedAt":"2026-10-09T00:43:18.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/37d4e70beec4574e9b457f547ecba779ae6a3ec96ca2f9d4a852ac50e9715247.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp 96w","itemId":"u81q4911rtnipir9p5gn39gd1","title":"安踏完成收购彪马29.06%股权，彪马能否成为下一个FILA？","summary":"安踏集团完成对德国运动品牌彪马29.06%股权的收购，现金对价为15.055亿欧元（约合人民币123亿元），交易已获全部监管批准并完成交割，安踏成为彪马第一大股东。彪马2025财年销售额经汇率调整后下降8.1%至72.96亿欧元，EBIT为-3.57亿欧元。文章认为，安踏可借助中国市场渠道和多品牌运营经验推动彪马转型，但彪马亏损及安踏持股比例不足以单独控制经营，也带来整合和盈利压力。","sourceName":"界面新闻","sourceUrl":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15168866.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T10:52:14.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"澳大利亚 AI 数据中心运营商 Firmus 撤回 50 亿美元 IPO 计划","summary":"获英伟达支持的澳大利亚 AI 数据中心运营商 Firmus 表示，因市场波动与市场状况，公司已撤回原计划筹资 50 亿美元的 IPO。Firmus 原拟以每股 11 澳元定价，估值约 306 亿美元，并将转向私募市场融资，同时考虑其他公开与私募市场选项。","sourceName":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2295372","publishedAt":"2026-10-10T07:16:44.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"qw94eivpmjrsdf5arvdzwaf5y"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"a16z领投TypeSafe AI $870 million Series A，估值达$7.5 billion","summary":"a16z领投TypeSafe AI约$870 million的Series A融资，使这家刚于2026年9月15日走出隐身模式的公司估值达到$7.5 billion。","sourceName":"Crypto Briefing","sourceUrl":"https://cryptobriefing.com/a16z-leads-typesafe-ai-series-a/","publishedAt":"2026-10-09T16:34:44.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"agrvu6283c46p5w22xwblu8hr"}]},{"label":"观点与教程","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"NFL向美国最高法院提交意见，主张体育预测合约属于赌博而非互换","summary":"NFL于10月8日向美国最高法院提交法庭之友意见书，支持新泽西州监管机构诉Kalshi一案，主张体育预测合约属于赌博而非互换，不应由CFTC专属管辖，并请求法院受理。NFL称，本赛季首个周日预测市场的33亿美元交易额中，近20亿美元与NFL赛事相关；Kalshi则称CFTC监管更为统一。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a11ca4-fddd-703b-8174-c762220f1195","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T17:51:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"t1x4yrfnlwdyjdtp1s39k3huz"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Samsung第三季度初步营业利润达107.40万亿韩元，AI需求推动芯片业务","summary":"Samsung Electronics公布第三季度初步营业利润为107.40万亿韩元（$80.2 billion），同比增长782%，营收约为195万亿韩元，同比增长近127%。公司表示，AI基础设施对内存的需求推动了芯片业务增长，并预计于本月晚些时候发布包含各业务部门细分数据的完整财报。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/08/samsung-q3-earnings.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-07T22:58:05.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"vzxz4pwcn2m7yrzfcjcaur57t"}]}],"flashes":[],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalStories":20,"selectedCount":504,"reportsCovered":4},"readingMinutes":8,"prev":null,"next":"2026-W42"}